    "description": "Propose [[wikilink]] insertions for backtick-quoted paths and unquoted prose path mentions in a single markdown file. Read-only by default. Say \"cross-link this file\", \"wikilink the references in\", \"convert backticks to wikilinks\", or \"retrofit links in\". Use after a session edits a file that names other wiki nodes in prose. Companion to wiki-build - cross-link writes the edges, wiki-build extracts them.\n",
